MT-Dc) with a given DN body / DN cartridge combination is certified in three G-value variants (42 variants total). Qmin is given under two conditions: measuring ratio (MR) 1:30 for pressures 0-101 bar(g) and MR 1:50 for pressures 4-101 bar(g). Number of drums is given as drums before/after the decimal comma (8/0). Bearing dimensions are inside diameter x outside diameter x width (mm) at 0-101 bar(g), for standard and optional bearings, front and rear. Table sections per header: Main characteristics (type, DN body, DN cartridge, G-value); 1.2 Essential characteristics (Qmax, Qt, Qmin); 1.4 Conditional parts (number of drums, control element); 1.1 Essential parts (blade angle, blade quantity, bearings). Blade angle '45/30' indicates either 45 or 30 degrees is allowed for that variant. control_element value transcribed from '0,2'; unit transcribed as printed ('m³/lh').\",\n      \"footnotes\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}"
